{"_id":"agBH25q91QHkBMkq","img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/hellbreakers-bestiary/gredress-tilnanos.webp","items":[{"_id":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","name":"Arcane Prepared Spells","sort":100000,"system":{"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"description":{"value":""},"prepared":{"flexible":false,"value":"prepared"},"proficiency":{"value":1},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slots":{"slot0":{"max":5,"prepared":[{"id":"ZJ1mmBhvQ13eIzyA"},{"id":"URn1wMuJoRCcNuNL"},{"id":"V0KER9CC8ycoMeqb"},{"id":"XcuPb7SNC597YAWQ"},{"id":"gy41CKzvHlbhDCPR"}]},"slot1":{"max":4,"prepared":[{"id":"1P8oJuO8bFdxVtzV"},{"id":"1P8oJuO8bFdxVtzV"},{"id":"gcaJUmXzlqkVLkeU"},{"id":"q1AvLOdtSaNR4NPE"}]},"slot2":{"max":4,"prepared":[{"id":"js9TOs5y1lonFoKZ"},{"id":"iw0u0a7eHrMQ2yn1"},{"id":"RoVJjmn8qDKCtbYb"},{"id":"e3KPMKlczgipxh3s"}]},"slot3":{"max":4,"prepared":[{"id":"CjTTQrFEmttVdygN"},{"id":"0C7SQ8e1ChTZR1ri"},{"id":"2rDgaZsz1dJddXn1"},{"id":"la4fRDrYXcID1vg4"}]},"slot4":{"max":3,"prepared":[{"id":"8lp2d7EIpBYiiztt"},{"id":"DYgOCJDvBBUrvaWQ"},{"id":"hm8Knhw4U1SV4RIs"}]}},"slug":null,"spelldc":{"dc":25,"value":17},"tradition":{"value":"arcane"},"traits":{},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spellcastingEntry","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},{"_id":"8lp2d7EIpBYiiztt","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.qJQADktwD0x8kLAy"},"folder":"7cyoYPoPYA01mErU","img":"icons/magic/unholy/orb-beam-pink.webp","name":"Containment","sort":200000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"reflex"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You wrap a creature in an immobile force field, whether to protect it or those around it. The field blocks attacks, effects, and creatures that would pass through it, including the target. The field has Hardness 10, 40 Hit Points, and immunity to critical hits and precision damage. If the target of containment is unwilling, the effects depend on the target's Reflex save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target escapes from the field as it's forming, causing it to collapse.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The field partially forms with 10 Hit Points instead of 40.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The field has its normal effect.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The field's Hit Points are 5 higher on a success or 15 higher on a failure.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 minute"},"level":{"value":4},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core 2"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"containment","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["concentrate","force","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.8lp2d7EIpBYiiztt"},{"_id":"DYgOCJDvBBUrvaWQ","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8"},"folder":"7cyoYPoPYA01mErU","img":"icons/magic/symbols/ring-circle-smoke-blue.webp","name":"Translocate","sort":300000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"levels":{"5":{"range":{"value":"1 mile"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":4},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"translocate","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","teleportation"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.DYgOCJDvBBUrvaWQ"},{"_id":"hm8Knhw4U1SV4RIs","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Jmxru8zMdYMRuO5n"},"folder":"7cyoYPoPYA01mErU","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/phantasmal-killer.webp","name":"Vision of Death","sort":400000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"8d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"mental"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You force the target to see a vision of its own death. It takes 8d6 mental damage with a Will save. If the target is reduced to 0 HP by this spell, its vision becomes reality and kills it instantly.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4} and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for as long as it's frightened.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":4},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"vision-of-death","target":{"value":"1 living creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["concentrate","death","emotion","fear","manipulate","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.hm8Knhw4U1SV4RIs"},{"_id":"CjTTQrFEmttVdygN","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.T4QKmtYPeCgYxVGe"},"folder":"4fJHnYFqH0VjZXPv","img":"icons/magic/water/pseudopod-swirl-blue.webp","name":"Crashing Wave","sort":500000,"system":{"area":{"type":"cone","value":30},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"6d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"bludgeoning"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"reflex"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You summon a crashing wave that sweeps away from you. You deal 6d6 bludgeoning damage to creatures in the area. The water also extinguishes non-magical fires in the area.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core 2"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"crashing-wave","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","water"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.CjTTQrFEmttVdygN"},{"_id":"0C7SQ8e1ChTZR1ri","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.sxQZ6yqTn0czJxVd"},"img":"icons/magic/fire/projectile-fireball-orange-yellow.webp","name":"Fireball","sort":600000,"system":{"area":{"type":"burst","value":20},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"6d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"fire"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"reflex"}},"description":{"value":"<p>A roaring blast of fire detonates at a spot you designate, dealing 6d6 fire damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"fireball","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["concentrate","fire","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.0C7SQ8e1ChTZR1ri"},{"_id":"2rDgaZsz1dJddXn1","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.06pzGkKTyPE3tHR8"},"folder":"4fJHnYFqH0VjZXPv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/gravity-well.webp","name":"Gravity Well","sort":700000,"system":{"area":{"details":"30-foot-radius burst","type":"burst","value":30},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"reflex"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You create a sphere of altered gravity. All creatures and unsecured objects in the area move towards the center, depending on their Reflex saving throws. This follows the rules for forced movement. If there's not enough space near the center of the sphere, creatures and objects nearer to the center move first, and others move as far as they can without being blocked, up to the amount set by their saving throw outcomes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature moves 5 feet toward the center.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature moves 15 feet toward the center.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature moves 30 feet toward the center.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core 2"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"gravity-well","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.2rDgaZsz1dJddXn1"},{"_id":"la4fRDrYXcID1vg4","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.DCQHaLrYXMI37dvW"},"folder":"4fJHnYFqH0VjZXPv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/paralyze.webp","name":"Paralyze","sort":800000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You block the target's motor impulses before they can leave its mind, threatening to freeze the target in place. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Paralyzed for 4 rounds. At the end of each of its turns, it can attempt a new Will save to reduce the remaining duration by 1 round, or end it entirely on a critical success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"varies"},"heightening":{"levels":{"7":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"paralyze","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["concentrate","incapacitation","manipulate","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.la4fRDrYXcID1vg4"},{"_id":"js9TOs5y1lonFoKZ","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.3JG1t3T4mWn6vTke"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/blur.webp","name":"Blur","sort":900000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The target's form appears blurry. It becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}. As the nature of this effect still leaves the target's location obvious, the target can't use this concealment to Hide or Sneak.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 minute"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"blur","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["concentrate","illusion","manipulate","visual"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.js9TOs5y1lonFoKZ"},{"_id":"iw0u0a7eHrMQ2yn1","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.2ZdHjnpEQJuqOYSG"},"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/magic/earth/orb-lava-ball-yellow.webp","name":"Floating Flame","sort":1000000,"system":{"area":{"type":"square","value":5},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"3d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"fire"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"reflex"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You create a fire that burns without fuel and moves to your commands. The flame deals 3d6 fire damage to each creature in the square in which it appears, with a basic Reflex save. When you Sustain this spell, you can levitate the flame up to 10 feet. It then deals damage to each creature whose space it shared at any point during its flight. This uses the same damage and save, and you roll the damage once each time you Sustain. A given creature can take damage from floating flame only once per round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":true,"value":"1 minute"},"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"floating-flame","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["concentrate","fire","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.iw0u0a7eHrMQ2yn1"},{"_id":"RoVJjmn8qDKCtbYb","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.wzLkNU3AAqOSKFPR"},"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/magic/fire/orb-vortex.webp","name":"Noise Blast","sort":1100000,"system":{"area":{"type":"burst","value":10},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d10","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"sonic"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"description":{"value":"<p>A cacophonous noise blasts out, dealing 2d10 sonic damage. Each creature must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is deafened for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"noise-blast","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","sonic"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.RoVJjmn8qDKCtbYb"},{"_id":"e3KPMKlczgipxh3s","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.mrDi3v933gsmnw25"},"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-weapon-polearm-ice-blue.webp","name":"Telekinetic Maneuver","sort":1200000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>With a rush of telekinetic power, you move a foe or something they carry. You can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Dt6B1slsBy8ipJu9]{Disarm}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.7blmbDrQFNfdT731]{Shove}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.lOE4yjUnETTdaf2T]{Reposition}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ge56Lu1xXVFYUnLP]{Trip} the target using a spell attack roll instead of an Athletics check.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-maneuver","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["attack","concentrate","force","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.e3KPMKlczgipxh3s"},{"_id":"ZJ1mmBhvQ13eIzyA","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.thAHF1zxNplLCJPO"},"img":"icons/magic/acid/orb-bubble-smoke-drip.webp","name":"Caustic Blast","sort":1300000,"system":{"area":{"type":"burst","value":5},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"yI4fzrhnbFxup4Ep":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"1d8","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"acid"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"reflex"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You fling a large glob of acid that immediately detonates, spraying nearby creatures. Creatures in the area take 1d8 acid damage with a basic Reflex save; on a critical failure, the creature also takes @Damage[(1+floor((@item.rank -1)/2))[persistent,acid]] damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The initial damage increases by 1d8, and the persistent damage on a critical failure increases by 1.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"yI4fzrhnbFxup4Ep":"1d8"},"interval":2,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"caustic-blast","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["acid","cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.ZJ1mmBhvQ13eIzyA"},{"_id":"URn1wMuJoRCcNuNL","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4gBIw4IDrSfFHik4"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/daze.webp","name":"Daze","sort":1400000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"1d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"mental"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"will"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 round"},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":2,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"daze","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate","mental","nonlethal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.URn1wMuJoRCcNuNL"},{"_id":"V0KER9CC8ycoMeqb","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gpzpAAAJ1Lza2JVl"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/detect-magic.webp","name":"Detect Magic","sort":1500000,"system":{"area":{"type":"emanation","value":30},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies. You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your <em>detect magic</em> spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{Invisibility Potion}) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"detect-magic","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.V0KER9CC8ycoMeqb"},{"_id":"1P8oJuO8bFdxVtzV","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4koZzrnMXhhosn0D"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/fear.webp","name":"Fear","sort":1600000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"varies"},"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"5 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"fear","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","emotion","fear","manipulate","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.1P8oJuO8bFdxVtzV"},{"_id":"gcaJUmXzlqkVLkeU","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aEM2cttJ2eYcLssW"},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-sandals-tan.webp","name":"Fleet Step","sort":1700000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You gain a +30-foot status bonus to your Speed.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.ThFug45WHkQQXcoF]{Spell Effect: Fleet Step}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 minute"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"fleet-step","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.gcaJUmXzlqkVLkeU"},{"_id":"q1AvLOdtSaNR4NPE","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.jfVCuOpzC6mUrf6f"},"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/hydraulic-push.webp","name":"Hydraulic Push","sort":1800000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"3d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"bludgeoning"}},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You call forth a powerful blast of pressurized water that bludgeons the target and knocks it back. Make a ranged spell attack roll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes 6d6 bludgeoning damage and is knocked back 10 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes 3d6 bludgeoning damage and is knocked back 5 feet.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The bludgeoning damage increases by 2d6.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"hydraulic-push","target":{"value":"1 creature or unattended object"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["attack","concentrate","manipulate","water"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.q1AvLOdtSaNR4NPE"},{"_id":"XcuPb7SNC597YAWQ","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/light.webp","name":"Light","sort":1900000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You create an orb of light that sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) in a color you choose. If you create the light in the same space as a willing creature, you can attach the light to the creature, causing it to float near that creature as it moves. You can Sustain the spell to move the light up to 60 feet; you can attach or detach it from a creature as part of this movement.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you Cast the Spell while you already have four <em>light</em> spells active, you must choose one of the existing spells to end.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The orb sheds light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"until your next daily preparations"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"light","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.XcuPb7SNC597YAWQ"},{"_id":"gy41CKzvHlbhDCPR","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.OhD2Z6rIGGD5ocZA"},"img":"icons/magic/light/explosion-star-glow-silhouette.webp","name":"Read Aura","sort":2000000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical. You or anyone you advise about the aura gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} on the item. If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's rank is lower than the rank of your <em>read aura</em> spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"10 objects"}},"6":{"target":{"value":"any number of objects"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"rcJ4W5TkvDrGFTF2"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"read-aura","target":{"value":"1 object"},"time":{"value":"1 minute"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.gy41CKzvHlbhDCPR"},{"_id":"H91fpqLmPSX7S8ow","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.aXuJh4i8HqSu6NYV"},"img":"icons/weapons/polearms/spear-simple-engraved.webp","name":"Longspear","sort":2100000,"system":{"ammo":null,"baseItem":"longspear","bonus":{"value":0},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"bulk":{"value":2},"category":"simple","containerId":null,"damage":{"damageType":"piercing","dice":1,"die":"d8"},"description":{"value":"<p>This very long spear, sometimes called a pike, is purely for thrusting rather than throwing. Used by many soldiers and city watch for crowd control and defense against charging enemies, it must be wielded with two hands.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"invested":null},"expend":null,"grade":null,"group":"spear","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"sp":5}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"quantity":1,"range":null,"reload":{"value":null},"rules":[],"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":0},"size":"med","slug":"longspear","splashDamage":{"value":0},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["reach"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"weapon","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.H91fpqLmPSX7S8ow"},{"_id":"ryVaqSZq9cQ7wPix","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.dDIPA1WE9ESF67EB"},"img":"icons/equipment/chest/robe-layered-white.webp","name":"Robes","sort":2200000,"system":{"acBonus":0,"baseItem":"explorers-clothing","bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"unarmored","checkPenalty":0,"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Explorer's clothing is sturdy enough that it can be reinforced to protect you, even though it isn't a suit of armor. It comes in many forms, though the most common sorts look like clerical vestments, monk's garments, or wizard's robes, as members of all three classes are likely to avoid wearing armor.</p>"},"dexCap":5,"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"inSlot":false,"invested":null},"grade":null,"group":"cloth","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"sp":1}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder NPC Core"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"size":"med","slug":"explorers-clothing","speedPenalty":0,"strength":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["comfort"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"armor","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.ryVaqSZq9cQ7wPix"},{"_id":"MafATI9whUPMJXQj","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.U6XqhSFUUowHnnkk"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/armor/hellknight-plate.webp","name":"Hellknight Half Plate","sort":2300000,"system":{"acBonus":5,"baseItem":"hellknight-half-plate","bulk":{"value":3},"category":"heavy","checkPenalty":-3,"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Hellknights wear a variety of armors decorated with designs specific to the order. Hellknight half plate is the armor of choice for Hellknight signifers.</p>\n<p>A character who is a member of the Hellknights has access to these uncommon armors.</p>"},"dexCap":1,"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"inSlot":true,"invested":null},"grade":null,"group":"plate","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":20}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Treasure Vault (Remastered)"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"size":"med","slug":"hellknight-half-plate","speedPenalty":-10,"strength":3,"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"armor","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.MafATI9whUPMJXQj"},{"_id":"ldL413k00pgvZnif","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.FOWF5f0tCaApv9RE"},"img":"icons/sundries/books/book-symbol-spiral-silver-blue.webp","name":"Fiendish Hypotheses and Protections from Same (Spellbook)","sort":2400000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>A spellbook holds the written knowledge necessary to learn and prepare various spells, a necessity for wizards (who typically get one for free) and a useful luxury for other spellcasters looking to learn additional spells. Each spellbook can hold up to 100 spells. The Price listed is for a blank spellbook.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":1,"invested":null},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":1}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","slug":"spellbook-blank","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"equipment","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.ldL413k00pgvZnif"},{"_id":"rTaknDXHSO3mF25Z","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.XlmoKh60WMF9ou3J"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/worn-items/other-worn-items/secret-keepers-mask.webp","name":"Signifer's Mask","sort":2500000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>This mask is often devoid of eyeholes or other decorative features. The mask doesn't obscure your vision, though it makes it impossible for others to see your eyes. While wearing your <em>signifer's mask</em>, you gain +1 circumstance bonus to Deception checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ewwCglB7XOPLUz72]{Lie}, Intimidation checks, and Deception DCs against @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1xRFPTFtWtGJ9ELw]{Sense Motive}.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"inSlot":true,"invested":null},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Lost Omens Character Guide"},"quantity":1,"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":[{"or":["action:lie","action:sense-motive"]}],"selector":"deception","type":"circumstance","value":1},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"intimidation","type":"circumstance","value":1},{"key":"Sense","predicate":["feat:signifers-sight"],"selector":"darkvision"}],"size":"med","slug":"signifers-mask","traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","value":[]},"usage":{"value":"wornmask"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"equipment","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.rTaknDXHSO3mF25Z"},{"_id":"cah7DtpiMX62b2rT","flags":{"pf2e":{"linkedWeapon":"H91fpqLmPSX7S8ow"}},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Longspear","sort":2600000,"system":{"action":"strike","area":null,"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"bonus":{"value":17},"damageRolls":{"0":{"damage":"1d8+9","damageType":"piercing"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"config":{},"value":["magical","reach"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.cah7DtpiMX62b2rT"},{"_id":"8Xoqtmerpdbx1Rgu","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Fist","sort":2700000,"system":{"action":"strike","area":null,"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"bonus":{"value":16},"damageRolls":{"lPlX10uXw5UAMiQ0":{"damage":"1d4+9","damageType":"bludgeoning"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"config":{},"value":["agile","nonlethal","unarmed"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.8Xoqtmerpdbx1Rgu"},{"_id":"VJxxeLCAgKz1s9HI","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Diabolic Certitude","sort":2800000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>Some signifers are so assured of their power to control devils that they sometimes reach too far. When Gredress publicly espouses the superiority of Hell, she gains a +1 status bonus to skill checks, AC, and saves for 1 day. These bonuses don't apply against devils. At the end of the day, Gredress must attempt a @Check[will|dc:20] save or take a –1 status penalty to skill checks, AC, and saves against devils for 1 day (or –2 on a critical failure).</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.6bGS19fnwbv4E7mn]{Effect: Diabolic Certitude}</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"demonic-temptation","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["demonic-temptation"],"selector":["ac","saving-throw","skill-check"],"type":"status","value":1}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["divine","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.VJxxeLCAgKz1s9HI"},{"_id":"naPxWIBQxbkOgD8M","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Breach the Pit","sort":2900000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Gredress's last action was to cast a non-cantrip spell</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Gredress siphons energy drawn from Hell into her weapon. Until the end of the turn, the weapon deals an extra 2d6 damage.</p>\n<p>Roll 1d20 to determine the type:</p>\n<p>1–4 cold</p>\n<p>5–12 fire</p>\n<p>13–16 poison</p>\n<p>17–20 void.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"selfEffect":{"name":"Effect: Breach the Outer Rifts","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.68oispwYGLUUxjzt"},"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.naPxWIBQxbkOgD8M"},{"_id":"xS8f6u8VDcBepVGM","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Devil Summoning","sort":3000000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Gredress can cast a 5th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.29ytKctjg7qSW2ff]{Summon Fiend} arcane spell to summon a devil. To do so, she must sacrifice two 4th-rank prepared spells and voluntarily take @Damage[4d12[mental]] damage that can't be reduced or prevented. If Gredress is unable to Sustain the Spell, including if she's knocked out or killed, the spell continues, but the GM rolls a @Check[flat|dc:10] each round, ending the spell on a failure.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.xS8f6u8VDcBepVGM"},{"_id":"rskoGYiEEGDi0ngN","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/lore.svg","name":"Academia Lore","sort":3100000,"system":{"description":{"value":""},"mod":{"value":14},"proficient":{"value":0},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"lore","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.rskoGYiEEGDi0ngN"},{"_id":"Cu79oDJClJ9C9Reu","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/lore.svg","name":"Demon Lore","sort":3200000,"system":{"description":{"value":""},"mod":{"value":18},"proficient":{"value":0},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"lore","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!agBH25q91QHkBMkq.Cu79oDJClJ9C9Reu"}],"name":"Gredress Tilnanos","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":0},"con":{"mod":2},"dex":{"mod":1},"int":{"mod":4},"str":{"mod":3},"wis":{"mod":4}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":22},"allSaves":{